<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32434" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Olbĭa</span></b> , ae, f.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀλβία</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>the name of several cities.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A city in Pamphylia</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 27,
				26, § 96</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A city in Bithynia</i>, <i>afterwards
				called</i> Nicaea, now <i>Izmid</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 32,
				43, § 148</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Olbĭānus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj.: sinus, now <i>Golfo d' Izmid</i>, Mela, 1, 19,
			4.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A city in</i> Gallia Narbonensis, Mela, 2,
			5.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A city in Sardinia</i>, now <i>Terranova</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Q. Fr. 2, 6, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 8,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Flor. 2, 2, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 5,
				1, 2</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Olbĭensis</span></b> , e, adj.,
				<i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			Olbia</i>, <i>Olbian</i>: epistula. <i>from Olbia</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Q. Fr. 2, 3, 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				<i>the territory of Olbia</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					27, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
